sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Author
    participant API as API
    participant St as Store
    participant V as Viewer
    A->>API: create a prompt
    API->>St: version 1, immutable
    A->>API: edit
    API->>St: version 2 — never overwrite version 1
    Note over St: versions are immutable, so a shared link always resolves to what was shared
    A->>API: share — link, team, or public
    API->>St: record the visibility
    V->>API: open the link
    API->>St: check visibility and version
    St-->>V: that exact version
    V->>API: fork it
    API->>St: new prompt, parent recorded
